cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: 'tfm-anomaly-detection: Code for "Evaluating Foundation Model Embeddings for Anomaly Detection in Multivariate Tabular Data"'
abstract: >-
  Code, notebooks and evaluation for an empirical study of tabular foundation
  models (TabPFN, FoMo-0D, AnoLLM, ConTextTab) and classical detectors for
  unsupervised anomaly detection on tabular data with free-text columns,
  including text embeddings (FastText, sentence transformer) and
  model-internal TabPFN representations.
